* text=auto
*.sol text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
# The deployment record and the frozen round list are hashed as file bytes -- deployments.jsonl
# by its own sha256, the round list by Commit.s.sol's gate 1 and by the checker's listSha256. A
# Windows checkout that rewrote them to CRLF would make the local bytes differ from the committed
# ones, and a cross-machine comparison of that hash would then disagree for a reason that has
# nothing to do with the data.
*.jsonl text eol=lf
